        "text": "$\\frac12$"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Factor out the smaller power",
        "body": "$2^n=2\\cdot 2^{n-1}$, so $2^n-2^{n-1}=2\\cdot2^{n-1}-2^{n-1}=2^{n-1}$.\n\n**Answer: (A) $2^{n-1}$**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Test a value",
        "body": "Take $n=3$: $2^3-2^2=8-4=4=2^{2}=2^{n-1}$. The other choices give $2^5=32$, $2$, $2^6=64$, $\\frac12$, so only (A) fits.\n\n**Answer: (A)**"
      }
    ],
