    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Split the number",
        "body": "$111\\,222\\,333\\cdots999=111\\times(1\\,002\\,003\\,004\\,005\\,006\\,007\\,008\\,009)$, because $111\\times1=111$, $111\\times2=222$, and so on, shifted by three digits each time. The quotient $1\\,002\\,003\\,004\\,005\\,006\\,007\\,008\\,009$ has $1+8\\cdot3=25$ digits.\n\n**Answer: (E) 25**"
      }
